  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Anti-corruption Asset Confiscation Tool (ACT)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Efforts to reform the public administration and judiciary and create a robust anti-corruption system have largely failed to remove illicit assets attained through corruption and return them to public coffers. This has led to a widespread public perception of a political system in which a business/political strata is above the law and able to enrich themselves while the rest must resort to migration to better functioning countries in order to have a chance to prosper through merit and hard work.</narrative>
  </description>
